\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Completed exploratory training comparisons on nine geometries with three paired seeds. Bars show the relative reduction of seed-mean costs; markers show individual seed-pair reductions, not confidence intervals. Panel A compares fresh executions with MDM under a total 60-second budget, including initialization. Panel B uses a conditional fixed-support LKH replay from saved initialization states and excludes their generation cost. Positive values favor the hybrid. Neither panel provides independent test confirmation.}}{13}{}\protected@file@percent }
